$('#instructions').onclick=()=>modal('A GHOST IN THE GROOVE.',`<p><b>1. Drop the needle.</b> Start a fresh hunt.<br><b>2. Play the record.</b> Hold it, drag to scratch, or turn on hands-free spin.<br><b>3. Watch the static.</b> Look for a ghost-shaped patch whose dots move together. Background dots move independently.<br><b>4. Release and tap its body.</b> The second ghost gets a fresh location. Three misses restart the hunt.</p><p>Sound is optional. Slow Groove reduces essential motion speed. For keyboard play, use hands-free spin, focus the screen, move the capture cursor with arrow keys, and press Enter. Motion perception is essential to this experiment; it is not a universally accessible CAPTCHA.</p>`);
$('#notes').onclick=()=>{modal('THE GHOST. THE TRICK. THE LIMITS.',`<p>There is no word, image label, or hidden “correct” button to select. Dots are seeded across the field. Inside a ghost silhouette, dots share a motion phase; outside it, their phases differ. The experiment tests perception of coordinated motion rather than a semantic question.</p><p>Two fresh fields and a three-miss limit discourage blind guessing. This is a browser-local prototype, not production authentication. A source-aware agent or a bot that analyzes multiple frames can reconstruct the shape. We have not established independent human or AI success rates for this new mechanic.</p><p>This tab: <b>${caught}/2 captures</b>, <b>${events.length} capture attempts</b>, <b>${(totalMotion/1000).toFixed(1)} seconds of motion</b>. No raw pointer paths or personal data are stored.</p><button class="note-button" id="export">EXPORT THIS SESSION ↓</button>`);$('#export').onclick=()=>save(new Blob([JSON.stringify({version:'GHOST//FUNK 1.0',tester:location.search.includes('qa=1')?'author QA':'unclassified',complete:mode==='won',captures:caught,motionSeconds:+(totalMotion/1000).toFixed(2),events,limits:['Client-side demonstrator; source-aware or multi-frame agents can bypass.','No independent AI or first-time human trial has been measured.','The mechanic requires motion perception and is not universally accessible.']},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),'ghostfunk-field-notes.json')};
$('#privacy').onclick=()=>modal('THE ONLY THING WE COLLECT IS VIBES.',`<p>No accounts, names, emails, camera, microphone, biometrics, analytics, fingerprinting, cookies, or browser storage. The game runs locally in this tab. It keeps only temporary aggregate capture outcomes and play time; raw pointer paths are not stored. You can explicitly download your results.</p><p>Fonts and art are bundled. Hosting and the Sites sign-in gate maintain their own normal access behavior. This experimental motion game is not a production identity check.</p>`);
